ogle.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="pt_cruz"><IconStyle><color>ff8a8a8a</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="pt_local"><IconStyle><color>ff57616d</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Folder><name>1 · Percurso da maratona</name><Placemark><name>Percurso dos corredores (trecho Dublin 4)</name><description>Milltown Bridge → Milltown Road → Clonskeagh Road → Roebuck Road → Fosters Avenue → faixa de ônibus inbound da N11 → viaduto da UCD → faixa de ônibus outbound (no sentido inbound) → direita na Nutley Lane → esquerda na Merrion Road (inbound) → Pembroke Road → Northumberland Road.</description><styleUrl>#percurso</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.24500,53.31050,0 -6.24000,53.31200,0 -6.23400,53.31100,0 -6.22900,53.30850,0 -6.22400,53.30600,0 -6.21800,53.30500,0 -6.21200,53.30580,0 -6.21700,53.31050,0 -6.21990,53.31350,0 -6.22100,53.31800,0 -6.22280,53.32240,0 -6.22640,53.32500,0 -6.22960,53.32670,0 -6.23180,53.32870,0 -6.23520,53.33050,0 -6.23800,53.33300,0 -6.24400,53.33750,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>2 · Vias: fechadas, sentido único, desvios</name><Placemark><name>Merrion Road · Ballsbridge → Serpentine Ave [fechado]</name><description>Percurso da maratona. Fechada nos dois sentidos a partir das 10h.</description><styleUrl>#fechado</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23180,53.32870,0 -6.22960,53.32670,0 -6.22640,53.32500,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Merrion Road · Serpentine Ave → Merrion Gates [so_outbound]</name><description>Só outbound (para o sul) a partir da Serpentine Avenue. Inbound fechado.</description><styleUrl>#so_outbound</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.22640,53.32500,0 -6.22280,53.32240,0 -6.21850,53.32000,0 -6.21250,53.31650,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Nutley Lane [fechado]</name><description>Percurso. Fechada a partir das 10h.</description><styleUrl>#fechado</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.22280,53.32240,0 -6.22100,53.31800,0 -6.21990,53.31350,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Pembroke Road [fechado]</name><description>Percurso.</description><styleUrl>#fechado</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23180,53.32870,0 -6.23520,53.33050,0 -6.24080,53.33250,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Northumberland Road [fechado]</name><description>Percurso. Fechada a partir das 10h.</description><styleUrl>#fechado</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23520,53.33050,0 -6.23800,53.33300,0 -6.24400,53.33750,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Shelbourne Road [fechado]</name><description>Fechada a partir das 10h.</description><styleUrl>#fechado</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23220,53.32920,0 -6.23200,53.33250,0 -6.23350,53.33520,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Haddington Road [fechado]</name><description>Fechada a partir das 10h.</description><styleUrl>#fechado</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.24400,53.33380,0 -6.23800,53.33300,0 -6.23400,53.33450,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Anglesea Road [rds_sem_saida]</name><description>Aberta ao tráfego do RDS. Proibida a saída para a Merrion Road: quem entra por aqui sai por Donnybrook.</description><styleUrl>#rds_sem_saida</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23820,53.32000,0 -6.23650,53.32250,0 -6.23430,53.32580,0 -6.23180,53.32870,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Eglinton Road [desvio]</name><description>Desvio do tráfego outbound da Sandford Road para a Stillorgan Road.</description><styleUrl>#desvio</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.24700,53.32250,0 -6.23950,53.31950,0 -6.23820,53.32000,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Strand Road → Sean Moore Road → East Link [desvio]</name><description>Desvio do tráfego inbound da Rock Road. Não leva ao RDS.</description><styleUrl>#desvio</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.21250,53.31650,0 -6.20950,53.32200,0 -6.20750,53.33000,0 -6.21050,53.33550,0 -6.21900,53.34400,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Irishtown → Ringsend Road [desvio]</name><description>Alternativa do desvio para o norte da cidade.</description><styleUrl>#desvio</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.21050,53.33550,0 -6.22300,53.33800,0 -6.23000,53.34150,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Milltown Rd · Clonskeagh Rd · Roebuck Rd · Fosters Ave [percurso]</name><description>Percurso dos corredores antes da N11.</description><styleUrl>#percurso</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.24500,53.31050,0 -6.24000,53.31200,0 -6.23400,53.31100,0 -6.22900,53.30850,0 -6.22400,53.30600,0 -6.21800,53.30500,0 -6.21200,53.30580,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Linha do DART [dart]</name><description>Funciona normalmente. É a forma mais previsível de chegar.</description><styleUrl>#dart</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23300,53.33450,0 -6.22770,53.32810,0 -6.21720,53.32460,0 -6.21180,53.32000,0 -6.21250,53.31650,0 -6.20000,53.31050,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>3 · Rotas de acesso recomendadas</name><Placemark><name>V1 · Carro vindo do sul (Blackrock, Dún Laoghaire, Bray, M50)</name><description>N11/Stillorgan Road → Donnybrook → Anglesea Road → Anglesea Gate. Nunca pela Rock Road: nos Merrion Gates o inbound é desviado para a Strand Road e não chega ao RDS.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=Stillorgan+Road%2C+Mount+Merrion%2C+Dublin&amp;destination=RDS+Anglesea+Road+Gate%2C+Anglesea+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;travelmode=driving&amp;waypoints=Donnybrook+Church%2C+Stillorgan+Road%2C+Dublin+4</description><styleUrl>#carro</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.20150,53.29950,0 -6.20750,53.30300,0 -6.21200,53.30580,0 -6.21700,53.31050,0 -6.21990,53.31350,0 -6.22580,53.31500,0 -6.23180,53.31720,0 -6.23820,53.32000,0 -6.23650,53.32250,0 -6.23430,53.32580,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>V2 · Carro vindo do centro, do oeste e do norte (M1, Port Tunnel, N4, N7)</name><description>Leeson Street Upper → Morehampton Road → Donnybrook Road → Anglesea Road → Anglesea Gate. Não tentar Merrion Road, Shelbourne Road nem Northumberland Road.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=Leeson+Street+Bridge%2C+Dublin+2&amp;destination=RDS+Anglesea+Road+Gate%2C+Anglesea+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;travelmode=driving&amp;waypoints=Donnybrook+Church%2C+Stillorgan+Road%2C+Dublin+4</description><styleUrl>#carro</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.25300,53.33200,0 -6.25000,53.33000,0 -6.24500,53.32650,0 -6.24200,53.32350,0 -6.23820,53.32000,0 -6.23650,53.32250,0 -6.23430,53.32580,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>V3 · Saída de carro (todos os destinos)</name><description>Anglesea Gate → Anglesea Road → Donnybrook, e daí N11 (sul) ou Morehampton/Leeson (centro). É proibido sair da Anglesea para a Merrion Road.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=RDS+Anglesea+Road+Gate%2C+Anglesea+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;destination=Donnybrook+Church%2C+Stillorgan+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;travelmode=driving</description><styleUrl>#carro</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23430,53.32580,0 -6.23650,53.32250,0 -6.23820,53.32000,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>V4 · Saída alternativa para o sul (a confirmar com a Garda)</name><description>Entrada Simmonscourt Road → Merrion Road outbound (permitido a partir da Serpentine Avenue) → Merrion Gates → Rock Road. Só se a Garda confirmar que a boca da Simmonscourt fica liberada.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=RDS+Simmonscourt%2C+Simmonscourt+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;destination=Rock+Road%2C+Booterstown&amp;travelmode=driving&amp;waypoints=Merrion+Gates%2C+Dublin+4</description><styleUrl>#carro</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.22960,53.32330,0 -6.22640,53.32500,0 -6.22280,53.32240,0 -6.21850,53.32000,0 -6.21250,53.31650,0 -6.20200,53.30800,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>A1 · A pé do DART Sandymount</name><description>Serpentine Avenue até a Merrion Road (≈750 m); travessia controlada 1 no cruzamento com a Simmonscourt Road; calçada do lado do RDS para o norte até o portão P1 (≈250 m). Total ≈1,0 km, 13 min.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=Sandymount+DART+Station&amp;destination=RDS+Main+Entrance%2C+Merrion+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;travelmode=walking&amp;waypoints=Serpentine+Avenue%2C+Dublin+4</description><styleUrl>#ape</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.21720,53.32460,0 -6.22640,53.32500,0 -6.22960,53.32670,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>A2 · A pé do DART Lansdowne Road</name><description>Lansdowne Road e Shelbourne Road (fechada a carros, livre a pé) até Ballsbridge (≈450 m); travessia controlada 2 da Pembroke/Merrion Road; calçada do lado do RDS para o sul até o portão P1 (≈250 m). Total ≈700 m, 9 min.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=Lansdowne+Road+DART+Station&amp;destination=RDS+Main+Entrance%2C+Merrion+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;travelmode=walking</description><styleUrl>#ape</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.22770,53.32810,0 -6.23200,53.32980,0 -6.23180,53.32870,0 -6.22960,53.32670,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>A3 · A pé de Donnybrook (ônibus 46A, 145, 155, 39A, 11 e desvios do 4/7)</name><description>Da parada da igreja de Donnybrook pela Anglesea Road até o Anglesea Gate (≈750 m, 10 min). Não cruza o percurso. Rota interna do Anglesea Gate ao Ring 3: a confirmar com o RDS.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=Donnybrook+Church%2C+Stillorgan+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;destination=RDS+Anglesea+Road+Gate%2C+Anglesea+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;travelmode=walking</description><styleUrl>#ape</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23720,53.32050,0 -6.23820,53.32000,0 -6.23650,53.32250,0 -6.23430,53.32580,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>T1 · Táxi, preferencial e pessoas com mobilidade reduzida</name><description>Destino a informar ao motorista: «RDS Anglesea Road Gate». Embarque e desembarque dentro do portão. Não pedir «RDS Merrion Road»: o aplicativo pode tentar a Merrion Road fechada.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=RDS+Anglesea+Road+Gate%2C+Anglesea+Road%2C+Dublin+4&amp;travelmode=driving</description><styleUrl>#taxi</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-6.23820,53.32000,0 -6.23650,53.32250,0 -6.23430,53.32580,0 -6.23380,53.32590,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>4 · Pontos: portões, DART, travessias, postos</name><Placemark><name>RDS · portão da Merrion Road (P1, eleitores a pé)</name><description>rds_merrion · 53.32670, -6.22960</description><styleUrl>#pt_portao</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.22960,53.32670,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>RDS · Anglesea Gate (veículos, táxi, preferencial)</name><description>rds_anglesea · 53.32580, -6.23430</description><styleUrl>#pt_portao</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.23430,53.32580,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>RDS · entrada Simmonscourt Road (saída de veículos para o sul, a confirmar)</name><description>rds_simmons · 53.32330, -6.22960</description><styleUrl>#pt_portao</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.22960,53.32330,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Hall 2 · salão de votação</name><description>hall2 · 53.32620, -6.23120</description><styleUrl>#pt_local</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.23120,53.32620,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ring 3 · pátio de fila</name><description>ring3 · 53.32560, -6.23080</description><styleUrl>#pt_local</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.23080,53.32560,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>DART · Sandymount</name><description>dart_sandymount · 53.32460, -6.21720</description><styleUrl>#pt_dart</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.21720,53.32460,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>DART · Lansdowne Road</name><description>dart_lansdowne · 53.32810, -6.22770</description><styleUrl>#pt_dart</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.22770,53.32810,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>DART · Sydney Parade</name><description>dart_sydney · 53.32000, -6.21180</description><styleUrl>#pt_dart</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.21180,53.32000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>DART · Booterstown</name><description>dart_booterstown · 53.31050, -6.20000</description><styleUrl>#pt_dart</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.20000,53.31050,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ônibus · paradas de Donnybrook (Stillorgan Rd, igreja)</name><description>bus_donnybrook · 53.32050, -6.23720</description><styleUrl>#pt_bus</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.23720,53.32050,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Travessia controlada 1 · Merrion Rd × Serpentine Ave (pedir à Garda)</name><description>trav_serp · 53.32500, -6.22640</description><styleUrl>#pt_travessia</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.22640,53.32500,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Travessia controlada 2 · Ballsbridge (pedir à Garda)</name><description>trav_balls · 53.32870, -6.23180</description><styleUrl>#pt_travessia</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.23180,53.32870,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>P0 · «descubra sua seção», calçada da Merrion Road (lado do RDS)</name><description>p0_merrion · 53.32690, -6.22990</description><styleUrl>#pt_posto</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.22990,53.32690,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>G1 · recepção no Anglesea Gate (posto novo)</name><description>p0_anglesea · 53.32575, -6.23400</description><styleUrl>#pt_posto</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.23400,53.32575,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Embarque e desembarque de táxi e preferencial (dentro do Anglesea Gate)</name><description>drop_off · 53.32590, -6.23380</description><styleUrl>#pt_posto</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-6.23380,53.32590,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder></Document></kml>